# pass entry -> GitHub secret, for admin/sync-secrets.sh
#
#   <GH_SECRET_NAME>    <pass entry>    [actions|dependabot|codespaces]
#
# Columns are whitespace-separated; the third defaults to `actions'. Names only
# -- no values ever live in this file, which is why it is safe to commit.
#
# Nothing is listed yet, on purpose. This repo's CI (.github/workflows/gate.yml,
# labeler.yml) runs entirely on the automatic GITHUB_TOKEN and needs no secret
# of its own.
#
# The directory webhook secret deliberately does NOT belong here: no workflow
# consumes it, GitHub already holds its own copy in the webhook config, and
# pushing it to Actions would put a third copy somewhere a workflow could print
# it. See docs/secrets.md.
#
# When an MCP server lands (issue #1 item 2), its deploy credential goes here,
# e.g.:
#
#   CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN    github/dsp-dr/guile-skills/cloudflare-api-token    actions
